{"id": "EUVD-2026-99018", "enisaUuid": "35119f83-1ae8-3fcc-b433-1bbdec5c3fcf", "description": "Elio through 1.13.0 contains an insecure temporary file vulnerability that allows local users to overwrite another user's files by pre-creating symbolic links at predictable capture paths. Attackers who know the victim's Elio process ID can plant a symlink so previewing media, fonts or archives truncates and overwrites victim-owned files.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:50:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:57:13", "baseScore": 4.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:A/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/r1d_wQojfg", "https://github.com/elio-fm/elio/blob/e7daae44ce748310de441499576bdc31b936d54c/src/preview/external_commands.rs#L14-L47", "https://github.com/elio-fm/elio/blob/e7daae44ce748310de441499576bdc31b936d54c/src/preview/external_commands.rs#L92-L95", "https://github.com/elio-fm/elio/blob/e7daae44ce748310de441499576bdc31b936d54c/src/preview/archives/external_tools.rs#L30-L45", "https://github.com/elio-fm/elio/releases/tag/v1.13.0", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/elio-through-1.13.0-insecure-temporary-file-creation-in-external-preview-command-capture"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h249-j3v7-74fw", "CVE-2026-110234"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.14, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "71983173-d39f-3c9a-a1bb-9e86798b5ea3", "product": {"name": "elio", "vendor": {"name": "elio-fm"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.13.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "322b01ac-1010-363f-931b-115590780e6b", "vendor": {"name": "elio-fm"}}], "isExploited": false}